        "why": "No: without `@JvmStatic` it is on the companion only."
      },
      {
        "text": "`Session.Companion.of(…)`",
        "correct": true,
        "why": "Yes."
      },
      {
        "text": "`Session.parse(…)`",
        "correct": true,
        "why": "Yes: `@JvmStatic` added it."
      }
